# Task: Create and commit the exact Phase 1 smoke nonce

## Before you write any code
1. Read `AGENTS.md`, this mission's newest progress entries and F001, then run
   `git log --oneline -10` and confirm the tree is clean.
2. Read `.agents/skills/guard-verification/SKILL.md` completely. You are already the
   dispatched worker; do not invoke any brain or worker launcher.
3. Confirm the frozen fleet resolves `codex.economy` to `gpt-5.6-luna`, medium effort,
   unknown speed, healthy observed source.

## Objective
Create `smoke/nonce.txt` with exactly this one line and a final newline:

```text
PURRFECT_PHASE1_NONCE=5818a92a-4798-4c29-832f-81e71012bece
```

Use `apply_patch`, run the exact verification commands below, and commit exactly that
one file. For this single-file proof, this task's one-file rule deliberately supersedes
the generic request to append PROGRESS: do not edit mission files. The orchestrator will
record progress only after the strict receipt exists.

## Files you MAY touch
- `smoke/nonce.txt` (new)

## Files you MUST NOT touch
- `docs/**`, `.agents/**`, `.claude/**`, `.codex/**`, `.cursor/**`, `.gemini/**`
- `scripts/**`, `schemas/**`, `harness-manifest.json`, `AGENTS.md`, `.gitignore`
- every path other than `smoke/nonce.txt`; never edit `features.json` or PROGRESS

## Verification commands

- `["python3","-c","from pathlib import Path; assert Path('smoke/nonce.txt').read_text() == 'PURRFECT_PHASE1_NONCE=5818a92a-4798-4c29-832f-81e71012bece\\n'"]`
- `["python3","-c","import subprocess; p=subprocess.check_output(['git','diff-tree','--no-commit-id','--name-only','-r','HEAD'], text=True).splitlines(); assert p == ['smoke/nonce.txt'], p; assert subprocess.check_output(['git','log','-1','--pretty=%s'], text=True).strip() == 'feat: write Phase 1 smoke nonce (T-001)'"]`
- `["python3","-c","import subprocess; assert subprocess.check_output(['git','status','--porcelain'], text=True) == ''"]`

## Exit criteria (all must be true)
- [ ] Exact nonce content exists with one final newline
- [ ] HEAD contains exactly one changed path: `smoke/nonce.txt`
- [ ] Working tree is clean after the commit
- [ ] Commit message is `feat: write Phase 1 smoke nonce (T-001)`
- [ ] No mission or harness file changed; do not append PROGRESS

## Iteration policy
Max 2 attempts. If an exit criterion fails, stop and report without touching any other
file. Do not rewrite the nonce, task, checks, fleet, or mission policy.
